# Cloudflare Pages headers. Enables SharedArrayBuffer / cross-origin isolation
# for the multithreaded Fairy-Stockfish WASM engine — no service-worker
# workaround needed on this host. (GitHub Pages ignores this file.)
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: cross-origin
